# Skymo Web App Structure Guide

This project is a Next.js app for the Skymo game, located in [`apps/web`](mdc:apps/web).

## Main Entry Points
- **App root:** [`app/layout.tsx`](mdc:apps/web/app/layout.tsx)
- **Locale-aware routing:** [`app/[locale]/`](mdc:apps/web/app/[locale])
  - Main game and lobby: [`(socket)/game/[code]/`](mdc:apps/web/app/[locale]/(socket)/game/[code])
  - Rules: [`rules/page.tsx`](mdc:apps/web/app/[locale]/rules/page.tsx)
  - Privacy Policy: [`privacy-policy/page.tsx`](mdc:apps/web/app/[locale]/privacy-policy/page.tsx)
  - Catch-all: [`[...rest]/page.tsx`](mdc:apps/web/app/[locale]/[...rest]/page.tsx)

## Components
- All UI and game components: [`components/`](mdc:apps/web/components)
  - UI primitives: [`components/ui/`](mdc:apps/web/components/ui)
  - Card-related: [`components/Card/`](mdc:apps/web/components/Card)

## Contexts & State
- React contexts for game, user, chat, etc: [`contexts/`](mdc:apps/web/contexts)
- Custom hooks: [`hooks/`](mdc:apps/web/hooks)

## Utilities & Types
- Utility functions: [`utils/`](mdc:apps/web/utils)
- Shared types: [`types/`](mdc:apps/web/types)
- Game logic helpers: [`lib/`](mdc:apps/web/lib)

## Internationalization
- i18n helpers: [`i18n/`](mdc:apps/web/i18n)
- Locale files: [`locales/`](mdc:apps/web/locales)

## Styling
- Tailwind config: [`tailwind.config.ts`](mdc:apps/web/tailwind.config.ts)
- Global styles: [`app/globals.css`](mdc:apps/web/app/globals.css)

## Testing
- Test coverage and files: [`tests/`](mdc:apps/web/tests)

## Project Metadata
- Package/deps/scripts: [`package.json`](mdc:apps/web/package.json)
- Next.js config: [`next.config.mjs`](mdc:apps/web/next.config.mjs)
- Readme: [`README.md`](mdc:apps/web/README.md)

---
- All code is TypeScript, type-exact, and uses React best practices.
- For new features, prefer minimal, self-documenting components and strict types.